Task Summary: Write tests for AudioManager (TDD Red Phase)

=== Task ===
Write comprehensive tests for the AudioManager class that defines the API contract for audio management in the toddler game suite.

=== Changes ===
- Created: src/__tests__/audio/AudioManager.test.ts (295 lines, 22 test cases)

=== Test Coverage ===
Tests defined for:
1. init() - creates AudioContext, creates BGM audio with loop, creates 6 SFX audio elements, loads settings from storage, respects bgmEnabled=false
2. playBGM() - plays BGM, does nothing when disabled
3. pauseBGM() - pauses BGM audio element
4. playSFX() - plays each of 6 sounds (pop, correct, incorrect, wake, win, sticker), resets currentTime to 0, does nothing when disabled
5. setBGMEnabled() - updates localStorage, pauses BGM when false, can re-enable
6. setSFXEnabled() - updates localStorage, can re-enable
7. playFrogNote() - creates oscillator with correct freq (C4=261.63, E4=329.63, G4=392.0), sine wave type, starts/stops oscillator, respects SFX toggle
8. destroy() - closes AudioContext, pauses BGM

